    fix(optics): add REFLECTIVITY=0.95 to dielectric_dielectric surface for Mylar model
    
    exec22: complete the two-tier optical fix for the bar skin surface.
      Part 1 (exec21-optfix af5ddb7): dielectric_metal→dielectric_dielectric enables TIR.
      Part 2 (this commit): add REFLECTIVITY in the surface MPT to reflect non-TIR photons.
    
    Physics: at the bar-air interface (n_bar=1.58, n_world=1.0, theta_c=39.3°):
      angle > theta_c → TIR (100%, from Fresnel equations automatically)
      angle < theta_c → non-TIR, REFLECTIVITY=0.95 (Mylar/ESR substrate reflection)
    
    No air gap volume → no photon transport in vacuum → no superluminal velocity risk.
    sigmaAlpha=0 → perfectly polished surface, pure specular Fresnel + TIR.
    
    Files: src/Materials.cc:337-373 (CreateMylarReflector)
    
